Actions taken (chronological)
-----------------------------
1. Created a text-bundled ZIP snapshot of key project files and committed it to runkleblake0-tech/1/document-center/SEB_Integration_Hub_snapshot.zip.
   - Commit: 908d853b514f7290acae6ee79308b3847e2d6bf3
