3. Prepared project files and a releases/ snapshot for import into the new repo. The agent attempted to push; the first attempts failed due to write-permission restrictions. After permission was granted, the agent retried pushing files but encountered further authorization prompts; please verify the new repo contains the expected files and the releases/ snapshot.

Recommended next steps (if anything is missing)
-----------------------------------------------
- If the new repo is missing files, a local push from a user with write access will complete the import (commands included in the repository's top-level README).
- Create an official GitHub Release in the new repo and attach the ZIP (or use gh CLI: gh release create v1.0.0 releases/SEB_Integration_Hub_snapshot.zip --title "v1.0.0" --notes "Initial snapshot release").

